    "exact": "Selected native triplet, existing voice-owned sink constructor/service full extents, new complete format reader/selector bodies, bounded channel tables, interface GUID loads and COM call slots on the same opened image.",
    "direct": "Original negotiation obtains and normalizes mix format, tries requested channels, chooses mix/closest fallback, applies optional client/session settings, computes buffer timing, tries engine-rate Windows conversion before endpoint-rate native resampler fallback, acquires the render service and releases an initial silence buffer. It requires successful silence release, event setup, render service and sufficient device capacity before success.",
