    "conditional": "Finite IMMDevice/IAudioClient/IAudioRenderClient and optional session interfaces supply all endpoint responses. Returned formats use CoTaskMem allocation for original free. Bounded matched, channel/closest/rejection, rate auto-conversion/fallback, client properties/ducking and failure cohorts execute original negotiation; no real audio endpoint or Start is used.",
